    "en": "Sec 3"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "This Order shall take effect five davs after its\npromulgation.\nDone in the City of Manila, this 27th day of November,\nin the year of Our Lord, nineteen hundred and fifty, and\nof the Independence of the Philippines, the fifth.\nELPIDIO QUIRINO\nFresident of the Philippines\nBy the President:\nTEODORO EVANGELISTA\nExecutive Secretary"
